=== REASONING ===
- BackupRun type uses camelCase (types/admin.ts), not snake_case (api/types.ts) — hook imports from @/types/admin
- Status enum: 'completed'|'failed'|'running'|'queued' — map completed→green, running/queued→amber, failed→red
- No table_count or started_at on type — use completedAt/createdAt for timestamps, fileSize for size, backupType for retention/type display
- Compact (cols<=1): status dot + relative time + label
- Standard (cols>=2): 2×2 StatCard grid (Last Backup, Backup Size, Type, Status badge with red bg on failed)
- Wide (cols>=4): add list of last 5 runs with timestamp, size, status badge
- All strings i18n via t(), null-safe with ?? operators, fmtBytes helper for file sizes

